        "subject": "LU-20276 tests: Reclaim space before running sanityn/test_70b",
        "message": "LU-20276 tests: Reclaim space before running sanityn/test_70b\n\nOOM is happening when running sanityn/70b on ZFS 2.4.0. Brian's\nsuggestion on ticket is to reclain (wait -t free ...) as a\nworkaround before executing the test. The real fix is under ZFS\nunder (https://github.com/openzfs/zfs/pull/16722).\n\nThis patch adds \"zpool wait...\" so to not trigger OOM\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanityn fstype=zfs serverdistro=el9.7\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanityn fstype=zfs serverdistro=el9.8\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanityn fstype=zfs serverdistro=el10.1\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanityn fstype=zfs serverdistro=el10.2\nSigned-off-by: Arshad Hussain <arshad.hussain@aeoncomputing.com>\nChange-Id: I6c970ae6a98725156f7b1a2709457e1165ced11b\n"
      },
